    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664050/extras/ce4bfe36540df295ae790a38ced9aa42.avif?t=1726964349\" /></div><br><br>Tricks Magician is a game about a magician who has been trapped in an alternate reality because of his assistant rabbit's revenge, and now must overcome several challenges with a defying gravity and return to your normal world.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Interesting mechanics related to magic</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664050/extras/cab940da9d12c759c66c761fcdadb2f1.poster.avif?t=1726964349\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664050/extras/cab940da9d12c759c66c761fcdadb2f1.webm?t=1726964349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664050/extras/cab940da9d12c759c66c761fcdadb2f1.mp4?t=1726964349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Pixel art graphics</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664050/extras/2fbbe1eedee142f481b0458da0f47104.poster.avif?t=1726964349\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664050/extras/2fbbe1eedee142f481b0458da0f47104.webm?t=1726964349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664050/extras/2fbbe1eedee142f481b0458da0f47104.mp4?t=1726964349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Use the scenery to eliminate enemies</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/